{"id":"vod_bf_41524","vodId":"41524","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"摇曳百合3","name_cn":"摇曳百合3","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-42/94a5460e685fd593de55541ea6d1b547.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在七森中学中，茶道社因为人气不佳最终面临闭社的悲惨命运，单纯天真懵懂无知的赤座灯里（三上枝织 配音）、开朗热情的暴走少女岁纳京子（大坪由佳 配音）、沉默寡言但却是吐槽担当的船见结衣（津田美波 配音）和看似可爱人畜无害实则十分腹黑的吉川千夏（大久保瑠美 配音）四名女生占据了茶道社的活动教室，在这里另起炉灶成立了娱乐部。故事的序幕就此拉开。　　娱乐部的存在竟然引起了学生会的注意，身世神秘的会长松本理世（后藤沙绪里 配音）和傲娇不坦率的副会长杉浦绫乃（藤田咲 配音）的介入让本来就热闹的社团生活增添了一份欢乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:05:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yaoyebaihe3/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:42.349Z"}